hting', 'description': 'When you engage in two-weapon fighting, you can add your ability modifier to the damage of the second attack.', 'effect': {'two_weapon_bonus': 'ability_modifier'}}]}, 'level_gained': 1}}, 'feats': ['Tough', 'Great Weapon Fighting'], 'weapon_masteries': ['Scimitar', 'Greataxe', 'Greatsword'], 'equipment_main_hand': 'Greatsword', 'equipment_off_hand': None, 'equipment_armor': 'Chain Mail', 'equipment_shield': None, 'created_at': '2025-08-31T00:19:20.874089', 'updated_at': '2025-08-31T00:28:27.370521', 'notes': 'Created via character creator. D&D 2024 rules applied.'}, '2e1617bb-63af-4d2a-8648-d775c9a67009': {'id': '2e1617bb-63af-4d2a-8648-d775c9a67009', 'save_slot_id': '8f6207e1-35fa-473d-9a83-9f4781c7025f', 'name': 'Adventurer9', 'race_id': 'Human', 'class_id': 'fighter', 'subclass_id': None, 'background_id': 'Soldier', 'level': 1, 'experience_points': 110, 'strength': 16, 'dexterity': 16, 'constitution': 16, 'intelligence': 14, 'wisdom': 15, 'charisma': 8, 'armor_class': 16, 'hit_points_max': 15, 'hit_points_current': 15, 'hit_points_temporary': 0, 'max_hit_points': 15, 'current_hit_points': 15, 'hit_dice_max': 1, 'hit_dice_current': 0, 'death_saves_successes': 0, 'death_saves_failures': 0, 'conditions': [], 'spell_slots_current': {}, 'spell_slots_max': {}, 'class_resources': {}, 'class_resources_max': {}, 'last_short_rest': '2025-08-31T00:31:33.584590', 'last_long_rest': None, 'ability_uses': {}, 'ability_uses_max': {}, 'proficiencies': [], 'features': {'Second Wind': {'description': 'You have a limited well of stamina that you can draw on to protect yourself from harm. On your turn, you can use a bonus action to regain hit points equal to 1d10 + your fighter level. Once you use this feature, you must finish a short or long rest before you can use it again.', 'type': 'bonus_action', 'usage': 'short_rest', 'mechanics': {'action_type': 'bonus_action', 'healing': '1d10 + fighter_level', 'recharge': 'short_rest'}, 'level_gained': 1}, 'Weapon Mas